WEBVTT

00:00:05.958 --> 00:00:07.958
-<i>Good morning.</i>
-<i>Morning.</i>

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.083
10TH JAEWON FESTIVAL

00:00:17.708 --> 00:00:19.250
JAEWON HIGH SCHOOL

00:00:24.333 --> 00:00:26.041
-Look at the passenger!
-Huh?

00:00:28.291 --> 00:00:29.708
Seriously, who is that?

00:00:29.833 --> 00:00:31.541
Look at that car!

00:00:31.625 --> 00:00:33.083
There's a car like that in Korea?

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:34.666
LEADERS OF THE FUTURE
PHOTOGRAPHY CLASS

00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:36.958
All right, here we go. One, two, three!

00:00:37.041 --> 00:00:38.583
What the eff, dude?

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:41.166
-You think I'm this ugly?
-That looks fun.

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:42.750
BEAUTY AND MAKEUP CLASS BANG CUT STAFF

00:00:42.833 --> 00:00:44.833
Come over here
if you want to experience the magic of…

00:00:44.916 --> 00:00:46.333
I haven't cut my bangs in three months.

00:00:46.416 --> 00:00:47.333
Four months here.

00:00:47.416 --> 00:00:49.708
We need to see Jang-hyeon
from the beauty class at least once.

00:00:49.791 --> 00:00:51.666
My heart's already pounding.

00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:53.875
-Oh, gosh!
-It's all girls here.

00:00:53.958 --> 00:00:55.666
-Which school you from?
-Huh?

00:00:55.791 --> 00:00:58.083
-Jeongui Girls' High School?
-Oh, yeah, uh…

00:00:58.166 --> 00:00:59.250
Huh?

00:00:59.333 --> 00:01:01.666
Welcome to Jaewon High, huh?

00:01:10.833 --> 00:01:14.000
-Uh…
-Hmm.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:17.000
Do you like it?

00:01:17.416 --> 00:01:20.041
Uh, yeah, sure!

00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:02.666
We have lots of pretty clothes!
Come take a look!

00:03:02.750 --> 00:03:05.041
FASHION DESIGN CLASS - COOL TONE?
WARM TONE? FIND THE CLOTHES FOR YOU

00:03:05.166 --> 00:03:06.916
We're Jaewon High School's
Fashion Design class!

00:03:07.041 --> 00:03:08.041
PERSONAL COLOR

00:03:08.125 --> 00:03:09.125
Come right this way.

00:03:09.208 --> 00:03:11.166
This is the Fashion Design class's
clothing store.

00:03:11.291 --> 00:03:12.541
What do you think of this?

00:03:12.791 --> 00:03:16.250
Oh! Just like Doja.

00:03:16.375 --> 00:03:17.750
-Huh?
-What about this one?

00:03:18.083 --> 00:03:20.250
I think it would totally go great
with that top.

00:03:20.375 --> 00:03:21.666
How's it look?

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:24.333
Ah! You could beat Doja in that outfit.

00:03:24.416 --> 00:03:26.750
Oh! So, do I have the approval
of Mickey and Minnie?

00:03:29.916 --> 00:03:31.500
Thank you!
Come by again!

00:03:34.625 --> 00:03:36.291
10,000 WON IF YOU LAND A SINGLE HIT
IN A MINUTE

00:03:44.583 --> 00:03:46.333
Maybe the other guy is just bad.

00:03:46.708 --> 00:03:48.833
-Huh?
-Hey, Park Ji-ho.

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:50.500
Concentrate, man.

00:03:50.583 --> 00:03:53.708
-How many seconds left?
-Uh, three, two, one.

00:03:53.833 --> 00:03:55.166
Okay, the minute's up.

00:03:56.833 --> 00:03:58.666
He got tired out in just a minute.

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:00.333
Whoa, he must be really good.

00:04:00.416 --> 00:04:01.291
Wanna try again?

00:04:01.375 --> 00:04:04.125
Oh, no way, man. I'm all done!

00:04:04.208 --> 00:04:05.416
Whoa.

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:07.583
Huh? Oh!

00:04:08.291 --> 00:04:10.500
Looks like it's gonna start soon.

00:04:10.583 --> 00:04:13.375
Win ten thousand won if you can land
a single hit under a minute!

00:04:13.458 --> 00:04:14.875
Win ten thousand won!

00:04:14.958 --> 00:04:16.500
Does anyone else want to try?

00:04:16.583 --> 00:04:17.875
It's 5,000 won per try!

00:04:17.958 --> 00:04:19.416
Five thousand won per try!

00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:21.458
Oh, pretty lady!

00:04:21.541 --> 00:04:23.208
It's free for pretty ladies.

00:04:23.375 --> 00:04:25.708
Free!

00:04:32.416 --> 00:04:34.000
It's going to start soon.

00:04:34.166 --> 00:04:36.125
-It's almost time.
-Yeah.

00:04:36.666 --> 00:04:38.375
I'm nervous.

00:04:38.875 --> 00:04:41.291
I didn't know I'd be singing
on a stage as big as this.

00:04:41.750 --> 00:04:44.666
The festival showcase is like
the main event of the night.

00:04:44.916 --> 00:04:47.708
I know it'll be all right.
Let's just do like we did in practice.

00:04:51.875 --> 00:04:55.000
You practiced especially hard,
so be confident, Hyeong-seok.

00:04:55.583 --> 00:04:56.791
Oh.

00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:00.625
Huh?

00:05:03.333 --> 00:05:04.541
-Um, sorry…
-Huh?

00:05:04.625 --> 00:05:06.625
-…give me a sec. I'll be right back.
-Huh?

00:05:07.458 --> 00:05:08.625
Oh, uh…

00:05:10.416 --> 00:05:11.958
ARCHITECTURE CLASS
ARM-WRESTLE CHALLENGE!

00:05:12.041 --> 00:05:13.833
Oh, yeah,

00:05:13.916 --> 00:05:15.458
you're doing great, Basco!

00:05:15.583 --> 00:05:17.125
You got him!

00:05:21.083 --> 00:05:22.625
Yeah,
I knew Basco would win!

00:05:22.708 --> 00:05:23.708
What did I tell ya!

00:05:25.291 --> 00:05:28.250
Oh, he almost had it.
Okay, any other challengers?

00:05:28.333 --> 00:05:29.750
-Hmm.
-Basco's the best.

00:05:29.875 --> 00:05:32.000
Five thousand won
for one game of arm-wrestling.

00:05:32.125 --> 00:05:33.625
Get double your money when you win!

00:05:41.791 --> 00:05:43.333
Huh? Excuse me!

00:05:47.208 --> 00:05:49.625
Hello, you must be here for the festival.

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:53.291
-Who are you?
-Oh.

00:05:53.708 --> 00:05:56.583
Right! This is the first time
I'm meeting her in this body.

00:05:57.500 --> 00:05:59.291
Uh, that I, uh…

00:05:59.541 --> 00:06:02.833
Hitting on me by pretending you know me?
So obvious.

00:06:03.333 --> 00:06:04.375
What?

00:06:04.458 --> 00:06:07.208
-Uh, no. I…
-I guess it's worked for you until now.

00:06:07.708 --> 00:06:10.541
But don't act like you're all that
just because you're halfway handsome.

00:06:10.833 --> 00:06:13.208
<i>She's not being as nice as usual.</i>

00:06:13.958 --> 00:06:17.291
This whole school
is full of people like you.

00:06:17.791 --> 00:06:19.625
Who judge people solely on their looks.

00:06:20.208 --> 00:06:21.208
Oh.

00:06:21.291 --> 00:06:23.291
I was going to watch
the performances then go.

00:06:23.791 --> 00:06:26.541
But never mind.
I'm sick of all of this. Let's go.

00:06:26.833 --> 00:06:29.208
Uh. Oh, no, please wait.

00:06:29.833 --> 00:06:31.583
That's quite enough.

00:06:31.791 --> 00:06:33.958
-<i>How is he--</i>
-How persistent.

00:06:34.333 --> 00:06:35.708
She already explained this.

00:06:35.791 --> 00:06:37.833
She's had enough of you people.

00:06:37.958 --> 00:06:39.708
Step back, pretty boy.

00:06:39.833 --> 00:06:41.333
Don't make me hurt you.

00:06:45.166 --> 00:06:48.083
-Huh?
-Let go of me!

00:06:49.625 --> 00:06:51.375
<i>He shook off Jong-geon's grip?</i>

00:06:53.125 --> 00:06:56.708
-You little…
-<i>He's fast.</i>

00:06:56.875 --> 00:06:59.458
<i>A guard position? I got him.</i>

00:07:10.916 --> 00:07:12.791
You reacted to my kick…

00:07:12.875 --> 00:07:14.416
…and put your guard up.

00:07:14.541 --> 00:07:17.083
You've got a good eye. You're interesting.

00:07:17.541 --> 00:07:19.750
You're strong and light on your feet.

00:07:19.875 --> 00:07:21.500
Based on your stance…

00:07:21.583 --> 00:07:23.583
…you haven't been
properly trained at all.

00:07:23.666 --> 00:07:25.916
But you're not without talent.

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:28.208
If it were up to me I'd let you go.

00:07:28.458 --> 00:07:30.333
But I have to do
as my employer tells me to--

00:07:30.458 --> 00:07:31.625
Don't you dare!

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:35.333
-You really don't have to go this far.
-My orders were quite clear.

00:07:35.791 --> 00:07:38.250
To make sure no one touches
a hair on your head.

00:07:38.666 --> 00:07:40.958
And if anyone does try to touch you,

00:07:41.041 --> 00:07:42.666
to beat them…

00:07:42.750 --> 00:07:44.250
…to a bloody pulp.

00:07:44.333 --> 00:07:46.833
That's just the way it is. Sorry, guy.

00:07:48.125 --> 00:07:49.416
Hey, glasses.

00:07:49.625 --> 00:07:51.041
-Huh?
-Huh?

00:07:52.375 --> 00:07:54.083
What do you think
you're doing there?

00:07:56.541 --> 00:07:58.333
Basco?

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:00.791
This your friend?

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:04.083
BALGURE

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:06.083
That's right.

00:08:06.208 --> 00:08:07.416
BANANA POT

00:08:08.041 --> 00:08:09.208
I'm his friend.

00:08:09.958 --> 00:08:10.916
Huh?

00:08:12.791 --> 00:08:15.500
So don't be messing around with him.

00:08:16.041 --> 00:08:17.791
Or I'll teach you a lesson.

00:08:18.291 --> 00:08:21.916
Teach me a lesson?
Why do you talk like that?

00:08:22.375 --> 00:08:25.375
You're hilarious.

00:08:35.541 --> 00:08:37.125
-Glasses.
-Huh?

00:08:37.875 --> 00:08:39.500
Take off your glasses.

00:08:40.083 --> 00:08:41.583
<i>My punch had no effect?</i>

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:43.666
Remarkable.

00:08:43.833 --> 00:08:45.583
That didn't hurt?

00:08:48.791 --> 00:08:52.166
This school truly is so interesting.

00:08:53.250 --> 00:08:56.625
-Now, come on!
-Fine. I'll hit you!

00:09:00.166 --> 00:09:02.541
<i>I'm his friend.</i>

00:09:07.875 --> 00:09:09.541
Huh?

00:09:13.791 --> 00:09:15.875
<i>He stood up</i>
<i>after I kicked him.</i>

00:09:17.458 --> 00:09:20.291
Even if you both fight me,
you still don't stand a chance.

00:09:20.375 --> 00:09:21.458
-Jong-geon!
-Hmm?

00:09:21.541 --> 00:09:24.083
Do you want me to say
you're out punching people again?

00:09:24.333 --> 00:09:26.708
Jong-geon, don't do it.

00:09:26.791 --> 00:09:28.791
You have to go back to your old post.

00:09:37.416 --> 00:09:40.375
I got too excited.
Been a while since I fought anyone.

00:09:41.291 --> 00:09:43.666
You, "friend," can put your arms down.

00:09:44.083 --> 00:09:45.250
You too.

00:09:45.333 --> 00:09:47.416
I'd better start restraining myself.

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:48.833
-Huh?
-I need to take

00:09:48.916 --> 00:09:50.000
the GED as well.

00:09:50.541 --> 00:09:52.958
The GED?

00:10:00.875 --> 00:10:02.791
I'm sorry, you were hurt.

00:10:06.291 --> 00:10:08.291
Huh?

00:10:08.375 --> 00:10:10.125
You okay?

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:13.583
-So, who's the guy with the glasses?
-Oh, I don't know.

00:10:13.833 --> 00:10:14.875
We just met.

00:10:15.125 --> 00:10:18.000
If you and I fight again,
I promise I'll win.

00:10:18.208 --> 00:10:19.583
Saying that…

00:10:20.833 --> 00:10:23.458
I don't think I got what it takes
to beat Glasses.

00:10:24.375 --> 00:10:29.125
I'm just not strong enough.

00:10:38.041 --> 00:10:40.583
-Huh?
-Found it on my way here.

00:10:41.125 --> 00:10:42.875
Uh. Oh, thanks.

00:10:43.083 --> 00:10:45.166
<i>I first thought</i>
<i>it was because he wanted</i>

00:10:45.291 --> 00:10:48.000
<i>to use me in some way. That wasn't it.</i>

00:10:48.416 --> 00:10:50.166
<i>He always asks me</i>
<i>to eat lunch with him.</i>

00:10:50.375 --> 00:10:52.250
<i>And he never really asks me for anything.</i>

00:10:52.666 --> 00:10:55.375
<i>My mother gave him</i>
<i>that to pay for the coffee.</i>

00:10:56.375 --> 00:10:57.375
Hmm.

00:10:59.708 --> 00:11:03.416
-Thank you. I appreciate it.
-Hmm.

00:11:04.916 --> 00:11:06.708
If we fight again, I will win though.

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:08.666
Okay, okay.

00:11:09.083 --> 00:11:11.000
<i>Next is Jaewon High's</i>
<i>cutie pie…</i>

00:11:11.125 --> 00:11:13.041
-Oh, I'd better get going.
-<i>…Kim Seul-beom!</i>

00:11:13.166 --> 00:11:18.333
Hmm?

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:28.083
Wow, look at that.
Kids are so boisterous these days.

00:11:28.208 --> 00:11:31.083
Yeah, they sure are.

00:11:32.166 --> 00:11:33.583
Well, did I put it on right?

00:11:33.833 --> 00:11:36.291
Wow,
it looks great on you, Hyeong-seok.

00:11:36.833 --> 00:11:37.833
Thank you.

00:11:38.875 --> 00:11:41.041
For offering these outfits
for our performance.

00:11:41.166 --> 00:11:42.333
Hey.

00:11:42.416 --> 00:11:43.416
-Huh?
-Huh?

00:11:46.833 --> 00:11:48.625
Are your clothes going
to do the singing?

00:11:48.708 --> 00:11:50.791
<i>Next is vocal dance class's…</i>

00:11:51.208 --> 00:11:52.458
-Well…
-Hey!

00:11:52.541 --> 00:11:54.500
-…it's our turn.
-<i>…and Go Jeong-gi.</i>

00:11:56.583 --> 00:11:59.250
Just stay there
and watch how it's done.

00:12:09.708 --> 00:12:10.708
MAKE YOUR DEBUT, HO-BIN

00:12:23.083 --> 00:12:25.166
Oh, I'm in love with this!

00:12:25.416 --> 00:12:26.750
You're awesome!

00:12:27.125 --> 00:12:28.500
Hmm.

00:12:28.625 --> 00:12:31.333
The audience loves it.

00:12:31.625 --> 00:12:34.333
Yeah, might be because
a professional songwriter wrote it.

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:36.250
It is a really well polished song.

00:12:36.458 --> 00:12:39.916
I don't know if I can still sing.
There's such a big audience.

00:12:40.833 --> 00:12:42.375
Just think of someone that you love.

00:12:42.916 --> 00:12:45.208
Tell yourself
that you're singing your best

00:12:45.333 --> 00:12:49.000
for that one person that you love.
With your whole heart and soul.

00:12:49.375 --> 00:12:52.625
And then,
you have no reason to be nervous.

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:57.583
<i>Someone I love.</i>

00:13:05.083 --> 00:13:08.458
Encore! Encore! Encore! Encore!

00:13:08.666 --> 00:13:09.666
Hey, there.

00:13:10.041 --> 00:13:12.000
-Our song was freaking awesome.
-Huh?

00:13:12.500 --> 00:13:13.916
Yeah.

00:13:14.166 --> 00:13:15.083
Huh?

00:13:15.458 --> 00:13:16.750
It was good.

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:21.125
Don't pretend
like you're so cool about this, fat ass!

00:13:21.875 --> 00:13:25.208
Here's a knuckle sandwich
for your first show!

00:13:25.541 --> 00:13:28.333
Deok-hwa!

00:13:30.458 --> 00:13:32.333
What are you doing?

00:13:34.166 --> 00:13:35.291
What?

00:13:35.458 --> 00:13:36.958
You wanna settle this right here?

00:13:37.208 --> 00:13:38.708
Huh?

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:42.750
We'll decide who wins with our song.

00:13:43.041 --> 00:13:45.875
Yeah.

00:13:47.333 --> 00:13:50.708
Now, our last song
of the night is…

00:13:50.833 --> 00:13:52.833
It's a rather odd duo.

00:13:52.916 --> 00:13:54.375
A collaboration…

00:13:54.458 --> 00:13:56.833
-Let's do it, Hyeong-seok.
-…between the fashion class

00:13:56.916 --> 00:13:58.625
-and the vocal dance class.
-Yeah, Deok-hwa.

00:13:58.708 --> 00:14:02.208
Park Hyeong-seok and Pyeon Deok-hwa!

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:04.666
I'm so glad I came
to Jaewon Festival!

00:14:04.833 --> 00:14:06.416
I'm a guy,
but even I think

00:14:06.541 --> 00:14:07.541
he's freaking good looking.

00:14:07.708 --> 00:14:10.333
Yeah,
he makes the guys who were just on stage…

00:14:10.416 --> 00:14:13.000
-Hey, let's watch from the front!
-…look so ordinary.

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:19.916
Yeah, okay, his look is good.
But this biz ain't easy.

00:14:20.083 --> 00:14:22.916
He's gonna need more
than just a pretty face.

00:14:24.625 --> 00:14:27.666
Well, you must be that handsome guy
I've heard about.

00:14:27.833 --> 00:14:29.541
How did you come to perform today?

00:14:29.791 --> 00:14:33.250
Uh, what? Oh, um, well,
my friend over here asked me

00:14:33.333 --> 00:14:38.041
to perform a song with him tonight.
So, we've been practicing together since.

00:14:38.125 --> 00:14:40.333
So, you two are friends then. Really?

00:14:40.666 --> 00:14:43.125
It's like you're an entirely
different species.

00:14:46.208 --> 00:14:47.666
The emcee is good.

00:14:49.541 --> 00:14:51.833
-So fucking funny.
-Uh…

00:14:51.958 --> 00:14:53.500
I wonder how those two met.

00:14:53.583 --> 00:14:54.875
Sir! The short kid next

00:14:54.958 --> 00:14:56.083
-to the good looking one.
-Hmm?

00:14:56.166 --> 00:14:57.958
-The kid from the other day.
-Really?

00:14:58.166 --> 00:14:59.791
He came to audition last time.

00:14:59.916 --> 00:15:01.875
I didn't recognize him
because he changed his look.

00:15:02.375 --> 00:15:04.000
Someone like that showed up here?

00:15:04.375 --> 00:15:06.000
Okay, let's hear it.

00:15:06.125 --> 00:15:11.625
Park Hyeong-seok
and Pyeon Deok-hwa's song called "Fly Up!"

00:15:40.666 --> 00:15:42.833
-Yeah…
-Uh.

00:15:44.666 --> 00:15:47.208
Uh, I knew that idiot would do that.

00:15:47.416 --> 00:15:50.708
-Not everyone can perform on a stage.
-He can't even sing.

00:15:50.791 --> 00:15:52.916
He thought his looks would let him coast
through their song.

00:15:53.041 --> 00:15:54.458
What's with him,

00:15:54.541 --> 00:15:55.750
is he scared?
Whoa,

00:15:55.833 --> 00:15:57.041
that's got to be embarrassing.

00:15:57.125 --> 00:15:58.958
What was that? Not good.

00:15:59.041 --> 00:16:03.000
Poor kid.
Only thing going for him is his looks.

00:16:03.458 --> 00:16:06.750
<i>The crowd</i>
<i>is turning cold. I knew I couldn't do it.</i>

00:16:07.083 --> 00:16:09.625
<i>I've ruined everything</i>
<i>we've worked so hard for.</i>

00:16:27.458 --> 00:16:29.583
Oh, wow! He's freaking good!

00:16:32.750 --> 00:16:34.583
<i>Just think of someone that you love.</i>

00:16:35.250 --> 00:16:37.458
<i>Tell yourself</i>
<i>that you're singing your best</i>

00:16:37.541 --> 00:16:41.625
<i>for that one person that you love.</i>
<i>With your whole heart and soul.</i>

00:17:04.208 --> 00:17:05.416
Oh!

00:19:46.875 --> 00:19:49.333
Who are those guys?
They're amazing.

00:19:49.458 --> 00:19:51.166
Nice!

00:19:51.625 --> 00:19:53.791
They're seriously good!

00:19:54.083 --> 00:19:56.375
I can't believe Hyeong-seok's
a great singer too.

00:19:56.458 --> 00:19:58.250
-Wow, this is amazing.
-Yeah!

00:19:58.333 --> 00:20:03.291
-That's our buddy, Hyeong-seok.
-Hyeong-seok, you're so cool! Whoo!

00:20:03.583 --> 00:20:05.916
-You're the best!
-Huh?

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:07.291
Deok-hwa's awesome.

00:20:07.375 --> 00:20:09.125
Deok-hwa's freaking great too.

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:32.541
Yeah, it's all because of his looks.

00:20:32.625 --> 00:20:34.916
We should've won this.
This is Hyeong-seok's fault.

00:20:35.416 --> 00:20:36.833
-Not fair.
-Nope.

00:20:36.916 --> 00:20:38.333
-Huh?
-They were better than you.

00:20:38.791 --> 00:20:42.375
Those two cleaned the floor with you guys.
Wiped you out.

00:20:42.500 --> 00:20:43.833
-Uh. What?
-But…

00:20:43.958 --> 00:20:45.708
But what's going to happen to us now?

00:20:45.791 --> 00:20:47.333
What about the debut?

00:20:48.250 --> 00:20:50.416
-Don't call us. We'll call you.
-Huh?

00:20:51.666 --> 00:20:54.500
Oh, but… but, sir?

00:20:54.583 --> 00:20:56.583
Wow, Hyeong-seok, you seem like a pro.

00:20:56.666 --> 00:20:58.500
-I knew you two would win.
-You!

00:20:58.583 --> 00:20:59.583
-Huh?
-You're the kid

00:20:59.666 --> 00:21:01.458
who came to audition last time, right?

00:21:01.666 --> 00:21:05.500
Oh, uh, yeah.
Oh, you actually remember who I am?

00:21:05.666 --> 00:21:08.041
Of course I remember.

00:21:08.125 --> 00:21:11.000
And, honestly, you're not that bad really.

00:21:12.416 --> 00:21:14.416
I'm sorry for what happened last time.

00:21:14.791 --> 00:21:16.833
Oh.No worries.

00:21:16.916 --> 00:21:20.333
Here you go. This is my business card.

00:21:20.583 --> 00:21:22.208
-Um, really?
-No way!

00:21:22.791 --> 00:21:24.625
It's to my direct line.

00:21:25.916 --> 00:21:28.000
Oh, thank you so much!

00:21:28.916 --> 00:21:30.416
Oh, what?

00:21:30.500 --> 00:21:32.916
So make sure
to call me, Park Hyeong-seok.

00:21:35.791 --> 00:21:38.250
Oh, but what about Deok-hwa?

00:21:39.166 --> 00:21:42.875
Huh? Oh, him? He's good, I can't lie.

00:21:43.458 --> 00:21:47.000
As long as he doesn't go pro,
he'll do great anywhere.

00:21:48.083 --> 00:21:49.916
That's so cold-hearted.
How could you say that?

00:21:50.000 --> 00:21:53.375
It's not me who's cold-hearted.
It's the public.

00:21:54.291 --> 00:21:59.208
The public only eats when you put
the stuff they like on the table.

00:22:01.375 --> 00:22:05.791
Anyway, you know you should really sign
with us first, Park Hyeong-seok.

00:22:06.375 --> 00:22:08.250
We'll give you a big advance too.

00:22:08.875 --> 00:22:09.833
How about it?

00:22:12.166 --> 00:22:13.041
I am…

00:22:14.250 --> 00:22:15.958
-turning you down.
-What?

00:22:16.041 --> 00:22:20.000
What? You…
You're really turning me down?

00:22:20.291 --> 00:22:21.875
Yeah.

00:22:22.041 --> 00:22:23.458
-He's crazy.
-Hey!

00:22:24.000 --> 00:22:27.416
You know there's a long line
of kids who'd love to sign with us

00:22:27.500 --> 00:22:28.500
but can't, right?

00:22:28.666 --> 00:22:30.375
Hey, let's do an afterparty.

00:22:30.458 --> 00:22:32.250
-Party tonight!
-Party tonight!

00:22:32.333 --> 00:22:35.333
Mi-jin, I'm studying
at your place today, okay?

00:22:35.416 --> 00:22:36.958
I'm in if Mi-jin's going.

00:22:41.458 --> 00:22:43.666
EVERYONE IN THE WORLD
MIGHT LOOK DOWN ON ME

00:22:43.750 --> 00:22:47.208
<i>I don't know how to give up.</i>

00:22:55.250 --> 00:22:57.208
There's already 100,000 views!

00:22:58.000 --> 00:23:02.083
Oh, but, uh,
I've been edited out of it.

00:23:02.166 --> 00:23:03.750
SCHOOL FESTIVAL RAP

00:23:05.833 --> 00:23:09.250
Well, it doesn't really matter.

00:23:09.416 --> 00:23:11.958
It helped me think
of some great new rap lyrics.

00:23:12.625 --> 00:23:14.958
So, I'm okay.

00:23:15.125 --> 00:23:17.541
-And who cares about looks anyway?
-Yeah.

00:23:17.666 --> 00:23:21.000
In that moment
your looks, which had once divided you,

00:23:21.083 --> 00:23:22.541
didn't really matter anymore.

00:23:22.875 --> 00:23:26.583
That's right.
When you two sang, it resonated with me.

00:23:26.750 --> 00:23:28.041
I was so moved.

00:23:28.708 --> 00:23:32.291
I think when you were singing,
everyone listening in that audience

00:23:32.666 --> 00:23:36.458
could feel the emotion
that you two put into that song.

00:23:36.625 --> 00:23:39.708
-You came to see us?
-Oh! Huh? No. Uh-uh.

00:23:40.416 --> 00:23:45.041
The… the thought just came to me
when I watched this video.

00:23:46.083 --> 00:23:49.041
Hmm. Intriguing!

00:23:53.208 --> 00:23:54.541
We've arrived, sir.

00:23:56.958 --> 00:23:58.750
Oh, wait, wait!
Could you look this way?

00:24:00.500 --> 00:24:04.750
-DG!
-DG! DG! DG! DG!

00:24:04.833 --> 00:24:06.083
DG IS AN ARROW
DG PIERCES MY HEART

00:24:08.750 --> 00:24:13.500
DG! DG! DG! DG!

00:24:13.791 --> 00:24:16.208
DG! DG! DG! DG!

00:24:20.208 --> 00:24:21.583
INTERESTING!

00:24:22.500 --> 00:24:24.083
Huh? It's that guy.

00:24:24.791 --> 00:24:26.208
He's the one who fought Jong-geon.

00:24:30.708 --> 00:24:31.750
It's the song!

00:24:33.250 --> 00:24:35.791
<i>How is he singing that song?</i>

00:25:47.583 --> 00:25:48.666
Later, me.

